# Playwright (Gate 7). OUTPUT only — diffs, traces and the HTML report are
# regenerated on every run and are not worth reviewing in a diff.
#
# NOTE WHAT IS *NOT* IGNORED: `e2e/*-snapshots/`. The visual baselines are
# committed on purpose — they are the record of what the app looked like when
# the gate closed, and an unexplained change to one is a finding.
